WEBVTT

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.660
No way! I refuse to do it!

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:23.410
I can't abandon him! I swear,
I'll take good care of him!

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:24.950
Puni!

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:30.000
Hell no! I know the rest of us are gonna
get stuck taking care of him, too!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.200
Puni puni!

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.660
He already went and stuffed
himself in my helmet again!

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:36.330
Puni!

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:40.500
It's pretty traumatic seeing a head
stuck in there first thing in the morning!

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.540
But I'm trying to train him!
He can already hold out his hand!

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:46.370
Go on, Punitsuki! Give it to him!

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:47.200
Blargh!

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.080
--Puni!
--You've got it coming, dammit!

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.120
--Huh? That went wrong! That went wrong!
--You've got it coming, dammit!

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.620
--Huh? That went wrong! That went wrong!
--I'll show you wrong!

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:55.290
--Oh? How lively today...
--I'll show you wrong!

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:58.370
It sure is.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:11.950
"The Ones Within"

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:36.080
Listen, guys! Kudou says I can't keep him!

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:36.950
--I see... Oh, I've got it!

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:39.120
--Say something to he
--I see... Oh, I've got it!

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.910
--Hmm? About what?
--Akki can be the papa and
I'll be the mama! How's that?

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:42.790
--The damn little bean girl
won't listen to anything I say.
--Akki can be the papa and
I'll be the mama! How's that?

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:44.660
--The damn little bean girl
won't listen to anything I say.
--That's a great idea!

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.080
I'm glad you're both getting along well.

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:49.700
Like hell we are! It's worse now!

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:01.290
I... killed my big brother.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:14.200
What do you mean by you killed him?

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.450
I apparently had a big brother.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:25.790
I was young, so I can't even remember
his face or voice though.

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:27.750
Then how could you...?

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:33.870
It's just... I was told he was put
up for adoption because of me.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:37.790
My parents said it was done to protect me.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:40.790
"Records Section"
After that, I looked in the family registry...

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:43.750
...and found out he went missing
after being adopted.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:44.410
"Missing Person Notice"
"Report"

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:51.370
"Missing Person Notice"
"Report"
A death certificate is sent out if
they've been missing for seven years.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:54.500
Which means my brother is officially dead.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:01.790
Why did they only protect me?

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:06.750
That's why... I killed him.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.950
That's so idiotic.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.790
You stupid little bean...

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:13.330
Huh? You don't like <i>natto</i>?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:20.080
For Stage 7, you will be
playing hide-and-seek.

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:22.750
Seems normal.

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.790
So we're playing kid games now?

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:28.500
Oh, my, you all have the wrong idea.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.370
What do you mean then?

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.950
I mean exactly how it sounds.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:36.700
This won't be any ordinary hide-and-seek.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:46.040
The Curse-Stealing Sisters...

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:49.790
From the right: Misery, Isabella, Carrie.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:52.830
You're to hide and avoid these three sisters.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.870
The hiding area is limited to this 6th floor.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:05:00.660
You're restricted to your
personal rooms and the hallway.

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:07.540
As you can see, these ladies
are typically well mannered...

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:11.370
...and will quietly roam around
the halls on their own, but...

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:15.790
When I produce a sound
above a certain frequency...

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.450
...they like to get a little more rowdy.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:27.000
I say rowdy, but they'll only
give you a little curse.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.790
The first time, they'll take your sight.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:34.750
The second time, they'll take
your eyeballs themselves.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.160
You shouldn't die from it though.

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:41.410
As of now, Floor 6 is to be sealed.

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:46.870
Also, the locks on all eight
of your rooms will be forced open.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:54.410
Now then, it is up to you to hide
in one of your eight rooms...

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:58.080
...and hide from the three sisters for an hour.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:01.410
Every 15 minutes when I ring the bell,

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:06.080
the sisters will begin their
search of the nearest room.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:10.370
It's almost like Russian roulette with 3/8 odds.

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.910
And it will happen four times in total.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:16.950
You are correct. And furthermore...

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:23.540
To clear this stage, not a single person
can be cursed at the end of the game.

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:27.450
That is, everyone must be safe and sound.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:31.620
Well then, what do you say
we get started already?

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.580
"Inaba"

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.580
"Inaba"
This is bad...

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:45.910
What do I do? I left my panties
hanging to dry in the room.

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:48.410
This is super embarrassing.

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.870
How can you be so relaxed right now?

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:54.660
In seven minutes, Kayako, Tomie,
and Sadako are coming for us!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.750
Were those their names?

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:59.790
You'll get found in a second hiding like that.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.660
This time it's a game of luck, anyway.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:04.870
How is it... a game of luck?

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:06.700
Hmm? Oh...

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:09.870
As soon as they come in
the room, that's strike one.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:15.620
The thing is, we have to avoid
getting a second strike at all costs.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:19.290
And for that, the key is to...

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:25.540
Having said that, it's a tall order for
all of you to remain safe and sound.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.830
I will inform you of the rescue rule.

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:33.620
If you find a player who is pure
and has avoided the curse,

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.330
touching them will lift your curse.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:41.450
Will I even be able to touch those three?

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:45.120
No... If need be, I have to.

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.370
Yeah, but...

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:48.830
You closet pervert.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:53.330
No! I'm just mentally
preparing to lift the curse!

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:57.160
That's great and all, but what
are you doing in my room?

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:01.200
We're allowed to hide
wherever we feel like, right?

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:05.540
Sure, but aren't our chances
of survival better if we all split up?

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:12.000
The top contender at this
point in time is Mr. Onigasaki.

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:20.040
Onigasaki.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.000
Hmm?

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.660
Try not to be alone if you can help it.

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:24.660
Why?

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.080
Just because.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.500
Aha, scared of being alone?

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.000
Not a chance in hell.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.200
"Aikawa"

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:49.540
What a pain.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:52.410
"Kudou"

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:56.830
We're gathering in your room
for the last 15 minutes, right?

00:08:56.830 --> 00:09:01.750
Yup. Once we're all safe, I guess
we'll lift any curses all at once.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:05.500
"Move Freely" "Don't lift people's curses" "Akki!"
"Gather in 601" "Feel doorknobs and use
as landmarks to know where you're at"
The bell will ring at 15-minute intervals.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:08.250
We gotta survive twice,
but the third time is key.

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:12.290
We'll be good as long as one of us
is pure in the last 15 minutes.

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:15.790
The fourth time the bell rings
will be the big gamble though.

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:18.870
We'll all be together for the end.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:22.620
It's a 3/8 chance three times.
Think it's doable?

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.450
I wonder...

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.450
Did you take something to stay awake?

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:29.120
You should probably come and hide soon.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:30.120
Right.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:36.410
This feels so nostalgic...

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:39.000
I haven't played hide-and-seek
in two whole months.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.910
That's like nothing.

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:44.870
Thirty more seconds...

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.660
"Inaba"

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:51.700
Oh, dear me...

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:54.330
What an unlucky start.

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:12.000
That was Sarayashiki.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:15.950
That means all the girls then.
This isn't looking good...

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:22.540
Oshigiri!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.950
I found you!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.580
It's no use.

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:44.950
It's pitch-black...

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:47.790
Karin? Yuzu?

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:50.660
Guys, where are you?!

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:53.450
Himi, I'm right here.

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:56.250
Yuzu! Thank goodness!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:59.290
Looks like we got the curse right off the bat.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:00.410
Huh?

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:03.330
An eternal shadow of darkness...

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:06.290
This must be the fate of those cursed.

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:11.160
Um, I might be imagining things,
but I feel like my head is heavier.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.290
What a coincidence. Me, too.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.410
Must be a side effect of the curse.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.620
A side effect?!

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:20.080
More importantly, let's find Karirin!

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:21.200
Oh, right!

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:24.160
I haven't heard a peep
from her for a while now!

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:33.700
Th-This is... This softness...!

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:34.000
Is that you, Karirin?! Karirin!

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.830
"Squishy"
Is that you, Karirin?! Karirin!

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:38.160
"Punitsuki is happy"
"Squishy"
Shit, why won't you answer?!

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:41.700
Oh, Karirin! Hey! Karirin!

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:48.580
You should see how ugly your face is!

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.830
--It's so messed up!
--I-I'll kill you.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:55.330
Thank goodness. I can't get this off.
Can you lift the curse?

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:58.250
Kaikoku, that's a Pakamera.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:01.830
Um, I just have to touch it, right?

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:11.250
It came off! I'm sure glad
there's a rescue rule.

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:13.500
Anya, did you see that--

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:20.160
Trouble breathing? Have fun
breathing through your skin!

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:25.160
--Ah, you're killing me...
--You bastard. I won't forget this.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:26.330
Onigasaki!

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:27.870
"Kudou"

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.700
"Kudou"
It's not looking good.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.790
We underestimated the 3/8 chance.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:36.950
If we don't lift the curse right away,
we might get wiped out.

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:41.290
Then we need to split up after all.
Go get yourselves a good hiding spot.

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:42.540
Onigasaki!

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:50.580
You're being a bit overprotective, Oshigiri.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.660
"Hide-and-seek Round 2"

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:08.450
"Hide-and-seek Round 2"
"Begin"

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.790
"Roromori"

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.120
"Roromori"

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.410
I'm safe...

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:28.000
That's Roro for you...

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:39.290
These camera angles...

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:41.830
They're taken from Pakameras, too...

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:51.290
This is Roro and Iride, isn't it?

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.790
Why?

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.290
"New Version"
"13th Avenue Subject Data"

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:07.120
"Iride"

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:09.620
Shit! Damn thing won't come off!

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:11.540
We shouldn't have moved rooms!

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:15.620
I know... Now we've got
to get someone to lift the--

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:20.290
You okay?

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:29.410
Thing is, I heard occult girl scream
the first time, so aren't all the girls out?

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:35.700
It'll be fine if Onigasaki got Oshigiri
to go lift their curse, but I wonder...

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.000
I'm not going.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:37.910
Huh?

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:41.120
There's no way I'm letting
that masked jerk see me like this.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:45.120
It's your fault for laughing
at him like that, sheesh.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:48.910
I guess I'll go call for help then.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:00.040
"Iride"

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.580
Hmm? What's up?

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.450
Anya, she's here.

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:05.330
Huh?

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.660
She's blocking the door.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:14.700
Hurry... Hurry, let me see you...

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:20.000
Not good. If we get found like this,
she'll gouge out our eyeballs.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.330
Seriously?

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.830
I want to see you, please!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:29.500
Quickly, please!

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:54.040
Come out, come out...

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.200
I think she's leaving.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.160
Don't move an inch.

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:46.160
A-Achoo!

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.540
She's coming!

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:57.290
Shit, shit, shit, shit, shit!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.790
Akatsuki?

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.450
Yes?

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.540
Just hold it in.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.370
I'm sorry.

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:30.330
"Hide-and-seek Round 3"

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:31.450
"Hide-and-seek Round 3"
"Complete"

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.410
"Hide-and-seek Round 3"
"Complete"
Is everyone all right?

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:37.160
As you can see, we're not.
Someone lift our curse please.

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:40.580
Sorry. Anya and I are out as well.

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:43.450
Sorry, they found me again just now.

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:44.500
Me, too.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:45.950
You got caught again?

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:46.910
Excuse me?

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:49.000
How many times you plan to get cursed?

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:50.750
You're one to talk, idiot!

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:54.450
Eh?! We got found once!
We dodged round two!

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:56.580
One time or two is the same!

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.540
Say what? You're delusional!

00:18:58.540 --> 00:18:59.830
I'm completely sane!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:03.700
Huh? Then can anyone still lift the curse?

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:11.120
Seriously? Nobody?!

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.950
No, wait. There's still Aikawa.

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:16.200
That's right! Where's our
Makimaki?! Makimaki!

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.000
--Ack! Who just touched me?!

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.370
--Owowow! Please let go of my hair!
--Ack! Who just touched me?!

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:21.080
--Owowow! Please let go of my hair!

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:22.910
Who the hell just did that?!

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:24.700
That's my... my...

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:26.870
Zak! What's wrong, Zak?!

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:37.000
P-Please stop fighting! No fighting!

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:41.750
Wh-Who's that?! Who's that?!

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:43.080
Himiko.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:45.950
Aikawa!

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.500
Are you okay?

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:48.370
Yeah!

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:52.290
Sheesh! What if it stops
growing because of that?

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:55.410
Thank goodness it's still there.... Huh?

00:19:57.540 --> 00:20:00.620
Um, who might this be?

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:05.830
Makino! You were safe!

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.160
Did you say Makimaki?!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:09.200
Where did you end up hiding?

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.870
My room... sleeping.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.910
But, I got stuck.

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:15.410
You got stuck?!

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:20.580
That's our Makimaki! Hurry up
and give me a big hug, too!

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:23.410
Give me a break...

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.080
Glad you're safe, Aikawa.

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:27.120
Took you long enough to come, Makino.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.330
"Hug"

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:32.830
You jerk!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:34.790
Eh? Say what?!

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:38.790
Next round is the last, right?

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:42.290
In the end, we're all relying on luck.

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:45.830
This game kinda feels like
the most dangerous one yet.

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:49.660
We'll be fine, I'm sure.

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:53.370
We'll be fine. They won't come here.

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:56.160
Huh? How do you know that?

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:58.200
I just have a feeling.

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.040
Huh?

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.700
One minute until the last hide-and-seek.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.000
Huh?

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:10.540
In 30 seconds.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:16.040
In ten seconds.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:20.160
Nine, eight, seven, six...

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:24.830
...five, four, three, two, one...

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:41.450
♪ Ding dong, ding neigh. ♪

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:47.370
